 "note": "X_ITE 16.6.0 marks the DIS component as not supported. EspduTransform draws its children as a Group: the red box of E1 sits at the origin (not at translation 2 0 0, not scaled to a half), the 2 x 2 box spans x 128..191, y 88..151 at a camera distance of 9 to its front face. No dead reckoning runs (translation stays 2 0 0 with linearVelocity 1 0 0 and deadReckoning 2), no output fires, and `enabled` false does not hide anything (E3 draws). `visible` hides the subtree; addChildren and removeChildren act as on Group. The SFTime outputs default to -1 and geoSystem to GD WE. The fixture head names the DIS component because X_ITE drops the node otherwise.",
 "gaps": [
  "the bridge copies X_ITE: translation, rotation, scale, center, scaleOrientation of an EspduTransform are not applied (the specification says they place the entity like a Transform)",
  "no dead reckoning, no network (isStandAlone never fires), no articulation parameters; the DIS traffic cannot be tested from a scene file",
  "bboxDisplay draws no wire cube in the bridge (no shared bbox helper yet); X_ITE draws one"
